    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present this fine one bedroom apartment presented in turnkey condition located in the much sought-after area of Dublin 4. 45 Cranford Court is located on the second floor apartment and comes to the market in excellent, turnkey condition. An ideal opportunity for a first-time buyer or investors alike. \n\nThe accommodation comprises a generously proportioned living room filled with natural light, a modern fitted kitchen, a spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, and a bathroom completes the accomodation. The apartment also benefits lift access to all floors, and ample residents' parking. \n\nThe location of 45 Cranford Court is second to none to having UCD on the doorstep with both Donnybrook and Stillorgan villages only a stone's throw away with the abundance of shops and amenities both villages have to offer. The QBC is located only minutes away with a host of regular services, while the DART is within easy reach also."
      },
